  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融投資趨勢與策略",
    "sub_ename": "TRENDS AND STRATEGIES IN THE FINANCIAL MARKET AND INVESTMENTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨介紹金融市場與投資重要趨勢與策略，探討金融市場的重要議題，包括綠色金融、金融科技、國際貿易與匯率議題及年金改革及相關新興實務議題，達到學生能運用相關分析觀點於產業分析以及理解未來發展重要趨勢。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to introduce important trends and strategies in the financial industry and investment. This course explores important financial issues, including green finance, financial technology (FinTech), international trade and exchange rate, pension reform, and related practical issues. As a result, students will be able to apply relevant analytical perspectives related to the analysis of the financial industry and the understanding of the future development of important trends.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
